 <h3><u>Ley chalo baba</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Ley chalo baba</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Haay jab madine sey chala kafla karbobala. Tha ye sughra ke labo par nawha</font></p>
  <font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x3</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Apne hamraah suwe karbobala</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Apki yaad me roro ke mei marjawungi. Baba akbar ki kasam chain nahi pawungi. Meri saso ka bharosa na raha</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Kaflay walo ko pani bhi pilawungi mai. Apni aghosh me asghar ko sulawungi mai. Baba ye apse wadaa hei mera</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Mere kano me jo awaaz azaan ayengi. Mere akbar ki muje yaad bohot ayengi. Bhayi ki yaad na ban jaye qazaa. </li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Kaise akbar ke bina eid guzarungi mai. Kabhi tumko kabhi amu ko pukaryngi mai. Jab koi paas na honga baba</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Hupur garm hawa hongi safar me dekho. Apne aachal me chupalungi ali asghar ko. Yu na asghar ko karo mujse judaa </li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Khwab akbar ki urusi ke bohot dekhe the. Khaak hojayenge ay baba sab armaan mere. Dil yahi soch ke rota hai mera</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Chacha abbas aur sakina phuphi zainab se. Akhri baar mila do muje baba sabse. Phir ye bimar nahi dengi sadaa</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Bhayya abid ko dawaa roz pilawungi mai. Unki raho me nigaaho ko bichawungi mei. Tum kanizo ki tarha behr khudaa</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Acha mehmil me muje tumna bithaana baba. Tum muje raah me peydal hi chalaana baba. Na karungi me shikayat na gilaa.</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Maine manaa ke nahi kaam mera manzar mei. Baba itna to batado ke akele ghar mei. Zindaa rehpayengi sughra tanha</li>
    <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p>
    <li>Apne ham rahe suwe karbobala</li>
   </ol> <p>(Ley chalo baba, muje ley chalo baba) x2</p></font>
